## Project Structure

```
DriveTrack/
├── .env                          # Environment variables
├── docker-compose.yaml           # Full stack orchestration
├── api/
│   ├── Dockerfile
│   ├── app.js                    # Fastify entry point
│   ├── seed.js                   # Database seeder
│   ├── package.json
│   ├── db/
│   │   ├── mongo.js              # MongoDB plugin + indexes
│   │   ├── redis.js              # Redis plugin + geo
│   │   └── cassandra.js          # Cassandra plugin + schema
│   └── routes/
│       ├── driver.js             # CRUD + geo endpoints
│       ├── trips.js              # Trip lifecycle
│       └── analytics.js          # Cross-DB analytics
└── drivetrack-dashboard/
    ├── Dockerfile
    ├── nginx.conf                # SPA routing + API proxy
    ├── src/
    │   ├── components/           # Reusable UI components
    │   └── pages/                # Dashboard, Trips, Drivers, Analytics, LiveMap
    └── package.json
```

---

## Dashboard Features

- **Real-time Stats** — Live counters with animated transitions
- **Revenue Charts** — Weekly performance with area/bar charts
- **City Breakdown** — Performance comparison across cities
- **Driver Leaderboard** — Top drivers ranked by daily trips (Redis ZREVRANGE)
- **Live Activity Feed** — Real-time trip events
- **Trip Management** — Search, filter, and inspect trips
- **Driver Fleet** — Full driver profiles with status tracking
- **Analytics** — Heatmaps, cancellation rates, distance buckets
- **Live Map** — Real-time driver positions (Redis GEORADIUS)
- **Database Overview** — Architecture visualization

## API Endpoints

### Drivers
- `POST /drivers` — Create driver
- `GET /drivers` — List drivers (filter by city/status)
- `POST /drivers/:id/online` — Go online (Redis GEOADD)
- `POST /drivers/:id/offline` — Go offline
- `GET /drivers/nearby?lat=X&lng=Y` — Find nearby (Redis GEORADIUS)

### Trips
- `POST /trips/request` — Request trip (assigns nearest driver)
- `POST /trips/:id/start` — Start trip
- `POST /trips/:id/complete` — Complete (writes to Cassandra + MongoDB)
- `POST /trips/:id/cancel` — Cancel trip
- `GET /trips?city=X&date=Y` — Query by partition key (Cassandra)
- `GET /trips/active` — Active trips from Redis

### Analytics
- `GET /analytics/redis/live-dashboard` — Live counters (Redis pipeline)
- `GET /analytics/redis/leaderboard` — Top drivers (Redis sorted set)
- `GET /analytics/cassandra/trips-by-city` — Partition queries
- `GET /analytics/cassandra/multi-day` — Cross-partition aggregation
- `GET /analytics/mongo/revenue-by-city` — Aggregation pipeline
- `GET /analytics/mongo/top-drivers` — $lookup join
- `GET /analytics/mongo/hourly-heatmap` — Date operators
- `GET /analytics/report` — Cross-database combined report
- `GET /health` — Health check
